# Never normalise line endings.
#
# This is an archive: the point is that files come back out as they went in.
# Git's automatic CRLF handling rewrote static/files/bo_first and bo_last (the
# gamertag word lists, authored on Windows in 2007) end to end — 496 lines
# "changed" with no content difference. Left alone, that churn would repeat on
# every clone and checkout, and any genuine edit would be invisible in the diff.
* -text

# Belt and braces for the asset tree and the transcoded clips.
static/files/** binary
static/videos/** binary
